# C++ formatting for the walker (walker/src, walker/tests).
#
# Derived from the existing Google/2-space style so re-formatting is low-churn. third_party/ (the
# hl2sdk submodule) and src/netmsg_table.generated.inc (generated) are excluded at invocation, never
# by this file. ColumnLimit: 0 disables line reflow — the walker has intentional wide lines that
# should not be wrapped. The layout-sensitive headers' hand-aligned offset tables keep their
# byte-offset DOCUMENTATION under formatting: AlignTrailingComments keeps every trailing `// (V0: N)`
# comment column-aligned; only cosmetic type-column padding changes. So no `// clang-format off`
# guards are needed — the files are formatted like the rest. SortIncludes is off (order is deliberate).
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
IndentWidth: 2
ColumnLimit: 0
DerivePointerAlignment: false
PointerAlignment: Left
SortIncludes: false
